msgid "# Expert Parallelism Load Balancer (EPLB)"
msgstr "# 专家并行负载均衡器 (EPLB)"

msgid ""
"- Reduced Latency: Dynamically balances expert loads to minimize TTFT and TPOT by distributing workloads evenly across experts.\n"
"- Adaptive Scaling: Automatically adjusts to workload fluctuations while maintaining stable performance."
msgstr ""
"- 降低延迟：通过在各专家间均匀分配工作负载，动态平衡专家负载以最小化TTFT和TPOT。\n"
"- 自适应扩展：自动适应工作负载波动，同时保持稳定的性能。"

msgid "## Critical Considerations"
msgstr "## 关键注意事项"

msgid ""
"EPLB is not recommended in the following scenarios because the load-"
"balancing benefit may not offset its runtime overhead:"
msgstr "在以下场景中不建议使用EPLB，因为负载均衡的收益可能无法抵消其运行时开销："

msgid "| Value | Behavior | Typical use |"
msgstr "| 值 | 行为 | 典型用途 |"

msgid ""
"EPLB applies only to MoE models that support expert parallelism and whose MoE\n"
"quantization method exposes a complete expert-weight movement layout. Support\n"
"also depends on the selected model runner and hardware generation."
msgstr "EPLB 仅适用于支持专家并行且其 MoE 量化方法暴露完整专家权重移动布局的 MoE 模型。支持情况还取决于所选的模型运行器和硬件代次。"

msgid "| Weight format | MRv2 EPLB | Notes |"
msgstr "| 权重格式 | MRv2 EPLB | 备注 |"

msgid ""
"| BF16 / FP16 | Enabled | Uses the unquantized expert weights and biases. |"
msgstr "| BF16 / FP16 | 已启用 | 使用未量化的专家权重和偏置。 |"

msgid ""
"| W8A8 / W8A8 Dynamic | Enabled | Uses persistent per-expert weight and "
"scale tensors. |"
msgstr "| W8A8 / W8A8 动态 | 已启用 | 使用持久的每专家权重和缩放张量。 |"

msgid ""
"| W4A8 | Enabled | Uses persistent per-expert weight, scale, and scale-bias "
"tensors. |"
msgstr "| W4A8 | 已启用 | 使用持久的每专家权重、缩放和缩放偏置张量。 |"

msgid "MRv2 uses the upstream `EPLBConfig` fields:"
msgstr "MRv2 使用上游 `EPLBConfig` 字段："

msgid "#### MRv2 Load Collection Phase"
msgstr "#### MRv2 负载收集阶段"

msgid ""
"| `all` | Collect load from every batch. This is the default. | General and "
"mixed workloads. |"
msgstr "| `all` | 从每个批次收集负载。这是默认值。 | 通用和混合工作负载。 |"

msgid ""
"| `prefill` | Collect only from batches containing at least one prefill "
"request. | Optimize prefill balance and TTFT. |"
msgstr "| `prefill` | 仅从包含至少一个 prefill 请求的批次收集。 | 优化 prefill 均衡和 TTFT。 |"

msgid ""
"| `decode` | Collect only from batches containing decode requests and no "
"prefill request. | Optimize decode balance and TPOT. |"
msgstr ""
"| `decode` | 仅从包含 decode 请求且无 prefill 请求的批次收集。 | 优化 decode 均衡和 TPOT。 |"

msgid "For example, to collect only prefill load:"
msgstr "例如，仅收集 prefill 负载："

