msgid ""
"Ascend extends the upstream `policy` field without adding a second selector.\n"
"For example, use `--eplb-config.policy default` to run the upstream policy;\n"
"omit it or set it to `stair` to run STAIR."
msgstr ""
"昇腾扩展了上游的 `policy` 字段，而没有新增第二个选择器。例如，使用 `--eplb-config.policy default` "
"运行上游策略；省略该字段或将其设置为 `stair` 以运行 STAIR。"

msgid "## Performance Ceiling Analysis (`enable_force_eplb`)"
msgstr "## 性能上限分析（`enable_force_eplb`）"

msgid ""
"`enable_force_eplb` is an analysis-only switch that forces a deterministic\n"
"round-robin expert routing instead of the real MoE router output. It gives every\n"
"expert-parallel rank a synthetic, perfectly balanced token distribution, so you can\n"
"measure the performance upper bound (ceiling) of the expert-parallel / EPLB path\n"
"under ideal load balance."
msgstr ""
"`enable_force_eplb` 是一个仅用于分析的开关，它会强制使用确定性的轮询专家路由，而非真实的 MoE 路由输出。它为每个专家并行 "
"rank 提供合成的、完全均衡的 token 分布，因此你可以测量专家并行 / EPLB 路径在理想负载均衡下的性能上限（ceiling）。"

msgid ""
"`enable_force_eplb` replaces the real routing result, so model results and\n"
"    **accuracy are invalid**. It is **not for production** and must not be used for\n"
"    correctness or accuracy validation."
msgstr ""
"`enable_force_eplb` 会替换真实的路由结果，因此模型结果和**精度是无效的**。它**不适用于生产环境**，不得用于正确性或精度验证。"

msgid ""
"- Enable it through `additional_config`: `--additional-config '{\"enable_force_eplb\": true}'`.\n"
"- It requires expert parallelism and a MoE model; `num_logical_experts` must be divisible by the expert-parallel size.\n"
"- It cannot be combined with `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb`.\n"
"- See [`enable_force_eplb`](../configuration/additional_config.md) for the full parameter reference."
msgstr ""
"- 通过 `additional_config` 启用：`--additional-config '{\"enable_force_eplb\": true}'`。\n"
"- 它需要专家并行和 MoE 模型；`num_logical_experts` 必须能被专家并行大小整除。\n"
"- 它不能与 `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` 组合使用。\n"
"- 完整参数参考请参见 [`enable_force_eplb`](../configuration/additional_config.md)。"

msgid "## Feature Introduction"
msgstr "## 特性介绍"

msgid ""
"Expert balancing for MoE (Mixture of Experts) models in LLM (Large Language Model) serving is essential for optimal performance.\n"
"Dynamically rearranging experts during inference can negatively impact TTFT (Time To First Token) and TPOT (Time Per Output Token), as it requires global synchronization pauses that stall all in-flight requests.\n"
"Our solution aims to minimize the impact of these pauses. EPLB feature provides the following benefits:"
msgstr ""
"在 LLM（大语言模型）推理服务中，MoE（混合专家）模型的专家负载均衡对于获得最优性能至关重要。\n"
"在推理过程中动态重排专家会对 TTFT（首 token 时延）和 TPOT（每输出 token 时延）产生负面影响，因为这需要全局同步暂停，从而阻塞所有正在处理的请求。\n"
"我们的方案旨在尽量减小这些暂停带来的影响。EPLB 特性提供以下优势："

msgid "### Usage Scenarios"
msgstr "### 使用场景"

msgid "### Constraints and Limitations"
msgstr "### 约束与限制"

msgid "#### Models"
msgstr "#### 模型"

msgid ""
"A2 does not support redundant experts. On A2, `num_redundant_experts` must "
"be set to `0` in both runners. Examples in this page that use a non-zero "
"`num_redundant_experts` apply only to hardware that supports redundant "
"experts, such as A3 or 950PR&950DT Products."
msgstr ""
"A2 不支持冗余专家。在 A2 上，两种 runner 中都必须将 `num_redundant_experts` 设置为 `0`。本页中使用非零 "
"`num_redundant_experts` 的示例仅适用于支持冗余专家的硬件，例如 Atlas A3系列产品或 Ascend "
"950PR&950DT系列产品。"

msgid ""
"The following table summarizes the code paths supported by MRv2 EPLB. W8A8 "
"is covered by an in-repository model-level regression test that runs on "
"Ascend NPUs (`tests/e2e/pull_request/four_card/test_qwen3_mrv2_eplb.py`). "
"Other enabled formats have not undergone the same level of validation and "
"must be validated with the target model and hardware configuration before "
"production deployment."
msgstr ""
"下表总结了 MRv2 EPLB 支持的代码路径。W8A8 由仓库内一个在昇腾 NPU "
"上运行的模型级回归测试覆盖（`tests/e2e/pull_request/four_card/test_qwen3_mrv2_eplb.py`）。其他已启用的格式尚未经过同等程度的验证，在生产部署前必须使用目标模型和硬件配置进行验证。"

msgid ""
"| W4A8 MXFP | Rejected | The expert-weight layout does not support EPLB "
"movement; startup fails with `EPLB is not supported ...`. |"
msgstr ""
"| W4A8 MXFP | 拒绝 | 专家权重布局不支持 EPLB 搬运；启动失败并报错 `EPLB is not supported ...`。 |"

msgid ""
"| W4A16 | Rejected | The expert-weight layout does not support EPLB "
"movement; startup fails with `EPLB is not supported ...`. |"
msgstr ""
"| W4A16 | 拒绝 | 专家权重布局不支持 EPLB 搬运；启动失败并报错 `EPLB is not supported ...`。 |"

msgid ""
"| W4A16 MXFP | Rejected | The expert-weight layout does not support EPLB "
"movement; startup fails with `EPLB is not supported ...`. |"
msgstr ""
"| W4A16 MXFP | 拒绝 | 专家权重布局不支持 EPLB 搬运；启动失败并报错 `EPLB is not supported ...`。 |"

msgid ""
"\"Rejected\" means startup fails before serving: the quantization method does not\n"
"declare EPLB support (`supports_eplb = False`). This rejection is independent\n"
"of hardware generation."
msgstr ""
"“拒绝”表示在开始服务前启动即失败：该量化方法未\n"
"声明支持 EPLB（`supports_eplb = False`）。此拒绝与\n"
"硬件代际无关。"

msgid "## Feature Usage"
msgstr "## 特性使用"

msgid ""
"The STAIR defaults do not require tuning; see\n"
"[Tuning Suggestions](#tuning-suggestions) for the advanced STAIR parameters.\n"
"A minimal production configuration only needs the redundant-expert budget:"
msgstr ""
"STAIR 的默认值无需调优；高级 STAIR 参数请参见\n"
"[调优建议](#tuning-suggestions)。\n"
"最小化的生产配置只需要设置冗余专家预算："

msgid ""
"For short benchmark or accuracy-validation runs where you want quicker load\n"
"feedback instead of production stability, shrink the load window and the\n"
"rearrangement interval together (for example to `200`). These values\n"
"increase rearrangement frequency; do not use them as production defaults:"
msgstr ""
"对于短时间的基准测试或精度验证运行，如果希望更快获得负载\n"
"反馈而非生产稳定性，可同时缩小负载窗口和\n"
"重排间隔（例如缩小到 `200`）。这些取值\n"
"会提高重排频率；请勿将其用作生产默认值："

msgid "| Parameter | Required | Value range | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 是否必选 | 取值范围 | 默认值 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `window_size` | No | positive integer | `1000` | Number of recent steps "
"used for expert-load recording. |"
msgstr "| `window_size` | 否 | 正整数 | `1000` | 用于记录专家负载的最近步数。 |"

msgid ""
"| `step_interval` | No | positive integer | `3000` | Interval between expert"
" rearrangements. If it exceeds `window_size`, only the last `window_size` "
"steps of metrics are used. |"
msgstr ""
"| `step_interval` | 否 | 正整数 | `3000` | 专家重排之间的间隔。如果该值超过 `window_size`，则仅使用最近"
" `window_size` 步的指标。 |"

msgid ""
"| `num_redundant_experts` | No | non-negative integer | `0` | Number of "
"redundant physical experts. Must be `0` on A2. `(num_experts + "
"num_redundant_experts)` must be divisible by the expert-parallel size. |"
msgstr ""
"| `num_redundant_experts` | 否 | 非负整数 | `0` | 冗余物理专家的数量。在 A2 上必须为 "
"`0`。`(num_experts + num_redundant_experts)` 必须能被专家并行大小整除。 |"

msgid ""
"| `use_async` | No | `true` / `false` | `true` | Ascend MRv2 always runs "
"asynchronously. `false` is normalized to `true` with a warning. |"
msgstr ""
"| `use_async` | 否 | `true` / `false` | `true` | 昇腾 MRv2 始终异步运行。`false` "
"会被规范化为 `true` 并给出警告。 |"

msgid ""
"| `policy` | No | `stair`, `default` | `stair` on Ascend | Select `stair` "
"for the Ascend policy or `default` for upstream-policy comparison "
"experiments. |"
msgstr ""
"| `policy` | 否 | `stair`、`default` | 昇腾上为 `stair` | 选择 `stair` 使用昇腾策略，或选择 "
"`default` 进行上游策略对比实验。 |"

msgid ""
"| `log_balancedness` | No | `true` / `false` | `false` | Log expert "
"balancedness metrics. Incurs extra communication; recommended to leave "
"disabled and only enable it temporarily when debugging. Do not set it in "
"production configuration. |"
msgstr ""
"| `log_balancedness` | 否 | `true` / `false` | `false` | "
"记录专家均衡度指标。会带来额外通信开销；建议保持禁用，仅在调试时临时启用。请勿在生产配置中设置该项。 |"

msgid ""
"| `log_balancedness_interval` | No | positive integer | `1` | Interval "
"between balancedness log entries. Only relevant when `log_balancedness` is "
"explicitly enabled for debugging. |"
msgstr ""
"| `log_balancedness_interval` | 否 | 正整数 | `1` | 均衡度日志条目的间隔。仅在显式启用 "
"`log_balancedness` 进行调试时相关。 |"

msgid ""
"| `communicator` | No | `hixl`, `torch_gloo`, unset | Auto (`None`) on "
"Ascend | Leave unset to use HIXL when available and Gloo otherwise; set "
"`hixl` or `torch_gloo` to select a backend explicitly. |"
msgstr ""
"| `communicator` | 否 | `hixl`、`torch_gloo`、未设置 | 昇腾上自动（`None`） | "
"保持未设置以在可用时使用 HIXL，否则使用 Gloo；设置 `hixl` 或 `torch_gloo` 以显式选择后端。 |"

msgid ""
"Every field is optional: the engine starts with the defaults. Why the examples\n"
"above deviate from them, and when to do the same:"
msgstr "每个字段都是可选的：引擎以默认值启动。以下说明上述示例为何偏离默认值，以及何时应同样处理："

msgid ""
"- `num_redundant_experts`: the default `0` means no redundancy, so EPLB can\n"
"  only shuffle whole experts between ranks. For production, budget a small\n"
"  hot-expert reserve that keeps `(num_experts + num_redundant_experts)`\n"
"  divisible by the expert-parallel size — for example `16` for\n"
"  Qwen3-30B-A3B with EP 16, which gives every rank one spare expert slot.\n"
"- `window_size` / `step_interval`: keep the `1000` / `3000` defaults in\n"
"  production. The `200` / `200` values in the validation example exist only\n"
"  to shorten the feedback loop of short benchmark or accuracy runs; they\n"
"  increase rearrangement frequency and trade stability for faster response."
msgstr ""
"- `num_redundant_experts`：默认值 `0` 表示无冗余，因此 EPLB 只能在各 rank 之间整体调换专家。生产环境中，应预留少量热专家余量，使 `(num_experts + num_redundant_experts)` 能被专家并行度整除——例如对于 EP 16 的 Qwen3-30B-A3B，可设为 `16`，这样每个 rank 都有一个备用专家槽位。\n"
"- `window_size` / `step_interval`：生产环境中保持默认值 `1000` / `3000`。验证示例中的 `200` / `200` 值仅用于缩短短基准测试或精度运行的反馈周期；它们会提高重排频率，以稳定性换取更快的响应。"

msgid ""
"These fields may also be passed together as JSON through `--eplb-config`.\n"
"They must not be placed in `--additional-config` for MRv2: the only MRv2 EPLB\n"
"fields under `additional_config.eplb_config` are `load_collection_phase` and\n"
"`stair_config`; any other field is rejected at startup."
msgstr ""
"这些字段也可以通过 `--eplb-config` 以 JSON 形式一起传入。对于 MRv2，它们不得放入 `--additional-"
"config`：`additional_config.eplb_config` 下仅有的 MRv2 EPLB 字段是 "
"`load_collection_phase` 和 `stair_config`；任何其他字段都会在启动时被拒绝。"

msgid "#### MRv2 Communicator Selection"
msgstr "#### MRv2 通信器选择"

msgid ""
"Automatic selection requires the same HIXL binding class on every EPLB rank:\n"
"each rank resolves either the official `hixl` Python package distributed with\n"
"CANN HIXL or vllm_ascend's ctypes binding, which drives the local toolkit\n"
"libraries directly (`libcann_hixl.so`, for CANN distributions that ship the\n"
"library without the package). The ranks reach a group-wide consensus at\n"
"startup; if any rank has no usable HIXL binding, or the binding classes\n"
"differ between ranks, the whole group falls back to `torch_gloo` CPU staging\n"
"and the decision is logged."
msgstr ""
"自动选择要求每个 EPLB rank 上具有相同的 HIXL 绑定类型：每个 rank 解析到的要么是随 CANN HIXL 分发的官方 `hixl` "
"Python 包，要么是 vllm_ascend 的 ctypes 绑定（该绑定直接驱动本地工具库 "
"`libcann_hixl.so`，适用于随附该库但不含该包的 CANN 发行版）。各 rank 在启动时达成组内共识；如果任一 rank 没有可用的 "
"HIXL 绑定，或各 rank 之间的绑定类型不一致，整个组将回退到 `torch_gloo` CPU 暂存，并记录该决策。"

msgid ""
"STAIR leaves both per-rank and cross-node migration limits unrestricted by\n"
"default (`-1`) so that HIXL can use the available bandwidth. When the\n"
"communicator falls back to Gloo automatically, Ascend clamps only the limits\n"
"you have not set explicitly to `1` to avoid excessive CPU-staged transfers,\n"
"and logs the clamp; explicitly configured values are kept (for example\n"
"`cross_node_transfer_limit: 0` still forbids cross-node migrations) with a\n"
"warning. Explicitly setting `torch_gloo` or `hixl` also keeps your configured\n"
"limits untouched."
msgstr ""
"STAIR 默认将单 rank 和跨节点迁移限制都设为不受限（`-1`），以便 HIXL 能够使用可用带宽。当通信器自动回退到 Gloo "
"时，昇腾仅将你未显式设置的限制钳制为 `1`，以避免过多的 CPU 暂存传输，并记录该钳制；显式配置的值会被保留（例如 "
"`cross_node_transfer_limit: 0` 仍会禁止跨节点迁移），并给出警告。显式设置 `torch_gloo` 或 `hixl` "
"也会保持你配置的限制不变。"

msgid ""
"HIXL requires the CANN HIXL runtime and working device connectivity on every\n"
"EPLB rank. HIXL initialization or runtime failures fail fast instead of\n"
"falling back mid-flight, because ranks may disagree on transfer progress."
msgstr ""
"HIXL 要求每个 EPLB rank 上具有 CANN HIXL 运行时且设备连接正常。HIXL "
"初始化或运行时故障会快速失败，而不是在运行中途回退，因为各 rank 可能对传输进度产生分歧。"

msgid ""
"`load_collection_phase` is an MRv2 EPLB field under\n"
"`additional_config.eplb_config`. It controls which batch phases contribute to\n"
"the load window when the STAIR policy is active; it has no effect with\n"
"`--eplb-config.policy default`, and it does not disable routing or MoE\n"
"computation for non-matching batches."
msgstr ""
"`load_collection_phase` 是 `additional_config.eplb_config` 下的 MRv2 EPLB "
"字段。它控制当 STAIR 策略激活时哪些批次阶段计入负载窗口；在 `--eplb-config.policy default` "
"下无效，并且它不会对不匹配的批次禁用路由或 MoE 计算。"

msgid "Additional rules:"
msgstr "附加规则："

msgid ""
"- A value other than `all` requires `--enable-eplb`.\n"
"- Classification is performed once per batch. A batch containing any prefill\n"
"  request is classified entirely as prefill; otherwise it is decode. On\n"
"  disaggregated decode nodes, requests that recompute a prompt tail segment\n"
"  are not counted as prefill, so such batches are classified as decode.\n"
"- A batch that does not match `load_collection_phase` contributes zero load\n"
"  but still advances the shared EPLB window. This keeps load-window slots,\n"
"  scheduling, and communication aligned across data-parallel ranks.\n"
"- If no rank has recorded fresh load since the last rearrangement (for\n"
"  example, `prefill` is selected but traffic is pure decode), the next\n"
"  rearrangement is skipped instead of running on an empty window."
msgstr ""
"- 除 `all` 以外的值需要 `--enable-eplb`。\n"
"- 分类对每个批次执行一次。包含任何 prefill 请求的批次整体分类为 prefill；否则为 decode。在分离式 decode 节点上，重新计算 prompt 尾部片段的请求不计为 prefill，因此此类批次分类为 decode。\n"
"- 不匹配 `load_collection_phase` 的批次贡献零负载，但仍会推进共享的 EPLB 窗口。这使负载窗口槽位、调度和通信在各数据并行 rank 之间保持一致。\n"
"- 如果自上次重排以来没有任何 rank 记录到新的负载（例如选择了 `prefill` 但流量为纯 decode），则跳过下一次重排，而不是在空窗口上运行。"

msgid "#### MRv2 Constraints"
msgstr "#### MRv2 约束"

msgid ""
"MRv2 supports asynchronous EPLB only and normalizes `use_async=false` to\n"
"asynchronous movement. It rejects:"
msgstr "MRv2 仅支持异步 EPLB，并将 `use_async=false` 规范化为异步移动。它会拒绝："

msgid ""
"Validate the target model, topology, graph mode, and traffic independently\n"
"before production use."
msgstr "在生产使用前，请独立验证目标模型、拓扑、图模式和流量。"

msgid "## Tuning Suggestions"
msgstr "## 调优建议"

msgid ""
"The default STAIR policy already covers general workloads; change the\n"
"advanced parameters below only after measuring a specific need. They live\n"
"under `additional_config.eplb_config.stair_config`. Numeric fields must not\n"
"be booleans, and each field is range checked at startup."
msgstr ""
"默认的 STAIR 策略已覆盖一般工作负载；只有在测量到具体需求后，才应修改下面的高级参数。这些参数位于 "
"`additional_config.eplb_config.stair_config` "
"下。数值字段不能是布尔值，并且每个字段都会在启动时进行范围检查。"

msgid "| Parameter | Default | Range | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 默认值 | 范围 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `load_window_bins` | `64` | 2–256 | Maximum chronological bins used to "
"compress the upstream EPLB load window. |"
msgstr "| `load_window_bins` | `64` | 2–256 | 用于压缩上游 EPLB 负载窗口的最大时间顺序分箱数。 |"

msgid ""
"| `load_risk_quantile` | `0.75` | (0.5, 1.0) exclusive | One-sided standard-"
"normal quantile converted to a z-score for mean-plus-deviation expert and "
"rank risk. |"
msgstr ""
"| `load_risk_quantile` | `0.75` | (0.5, 1.0) 开区间 | 单侧标准正态分位数，转换为 z "
"分数，用于均值加偏差的专家和 rank 风险。 |"

msgid ""
"| `relative_balance_threshold` | `0.95` | (0, 1] | Rebalance when current "
"balance divided by the last committed balance is at or below this value. |"
msgstr ""
"| `relative_balance_threshold` | `0.95` | (0, 1] | "
"当当前均衡度除以最近一次提交的均衡度小于或等于该值时进行重均衡。 |"

msgid ""
"| `absolute_balance_threshold` | `0.90` | (0, 1] | Rebalance when current "
"balance is at or below this value. |"
msgstr ""
"| `absolute_balance_threshold` | `0.90` | (0, 1] | 当当前均衡度小于或等于该值时进行重均衡。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rank_transfer_limit` | `-1` | -1 or positive | Maximum outgoing and "
"incoming expert transfers for each rank in one layer plan. `-1` removes the "
"limit. |"
msgstr ""
"| `rank_transfer_limit` | `-1` | -1 或正数 | 单个层计划中每个 rank 的最大迁出和迁入专家传输数。`-1` "
"表示取消限制。 |"

msgid ""
"| `cross_node_transfer_limit` | `-1` | -1 or non-negative | Maximum outgoing"
" and incoming cross-node expert transfers for each node in one layer plan. "
"`-1` removes the limit; `0` disables cross-node transfers. |"
msgstr ""
"| `cross_node_transfer_limit` | `-1` | -1 或非负数 | "
"单个层计划中每个节点的最大迁出和迁入跨节点专家传输数。`-1` 表示取消限制；`0` 表示禁用跨节点传输。 |"

msgid ""
"| `replica_search_num_stages` | `4` | 1–8 | Number of risk-ordered expert "
"groups handled by the FlashTree-style replica search. |"
msgstr ""
"| `replica_search_num_stages` | `4` | 1–8 | FlashTree 风格副本搜索处理的按风险排序的专家组数量。 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `replica_search_radius` | `8` | 0–32 | Maximum distance from the greedy "
"extra-replica budget explored at each search stage. |"
msgstr "| `replica_search_radius` | `8` | 0–32 | 每个搜索阶段探索的、距贪心额外副本预算的最大距离。 |"

msgid ""
"| `replica_search_beam_size` | `64` | 1–128 | Maximum unique replica-count "
"candidates kept after each search stage. |"
msgstr ""
"| `replica_search_beam_size` | `64` | 1–128 | 每个搜索阶段后保留的最大唯一副本数候选数量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `placement_search_backtrack_limit` | `32` | 0–64 | Maximum feasible-branch"
" reversals while constrained LPT places one candidate. `0` disables them. |"
msgstr ""
"| `placement_search_backtrack_limit` | `32` | 0–64 | 约束 LPT "
"放置一个候选方案时允许的最大可行分支回退次数。`0` 表示禁用回退。 |"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid ""
"Balance is the reciprocal of the mean max-to-average rank-load ratio; STAIR\n"
"rebalances a layer only when the hysteresis gates above fire, so lowering\n"
"`step_interval` alone does not force continuous movement."
msgstr ""
"均衡度是平均最大与平均 rank 负载比值的倒数；STAIR 仅当上述迟滞门限触发时才会对某一层进行重均衡，因此仅降低 `step_interval` "
"并不会强制持续迁移。"

msgid ""
"2. Hardware Requirements:\n"
"    - Ensure that all NPUs have identical memory capacity and compute capabilities.\n"
"    - Network bandwidth must support expert redistribution traffic (≥ 10 Gbps recommended).\n"
"    - shm needs to be mounted for container"
msgstr ""
"2. 硬件要求：\n"
"    - 确保所有 NPU 具有相同的内存容量和计算能力。\n"
"    - 网络带宽必须支持专家重分布流量（建议 ≥ 10 Gbps）。\n"
"    - 容器需要挂载 shm"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend uses the upstream vLLM EPLB controller, configuration, load window,\n"
"asynchronous worker, and rearrangement lifecycle. Ascend adds the STAIR policy\n"
"(the default policy on Ascend), the HIXL and Gloo movement adapters, and the\n"
"`load_collection_phase` extension."
msgstr ""
"vLLM Ascend 使用上游 vLLM 的 EPLB 控制器、配置、负载窗口、异步 worker 以及重排生命周期。昇腾新增了 STAIR "
"策略（昇腾上的默认策略）、HIXL 和 Gloo 迁移适配器，以及 `load_collection_phase` 扩展。"

msgid ""
"The legacy vLLM Ascend dynamic, recording, and static EPLB modes belonged to\n"
"Model Runner V1 and have been removed."
msgstr "旧版 vLLM Ascend 的动态、记录和静态 EPLB 模式属于 Model Runner V1，现已移除。"

msgid ""
"The model-level validation uses Qwen3-30B-A3B W8A8 with asynchronous EPLB. Validate accuracy and performance with the target model, topology, and\n"
"traffic before production deployment."
msgstr "模型级验证使用 Qwen3-30B-A3B W8A8 配合异步 EPLB。在生产部署前，请使用目标模型、拓扑和流量验证精度与性能。"

msgid "#### Weight Formats"
msgstr "#### 权重量化格式"

msgid "### Asynchronous EPLB"
msgstr "### 异步 EPLB"

msgid ""
"Enable expert parallelism and upstream EPLB. Ascend selects the STAIR policy\n"
"by default and automatically uses the HIXL communicator when it is available\n"
"on every EPLB rank, falling back to Gloo otherwise. Movement is asynchronous\n"
"only."
msgstr ""
"启用专家并行和上游 EPLB。昇腾默认选择 STAIR 策略，当每个 EPLB rank 上都可用 HIXL 通信器时会自动使用 HIXL，否则回退到 "
"Gloo。迁移仅支持异步方式。"

msgid ""
"- elastic expert parallelism,\n"
"- legacy `dynamic_eplb`, recording/static-map fields, and the `DYNAMIC_EPLB`\n"
"  and `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD` environment variables, all of which belonged to the\n"
"  removed Model Runner V1 EPLB implementation,\n"
"- communicators other than Gloo and HIXL,\n"
"- weight offload and prefetch: enabling EPLB with `cpu_offload_gb > 0` or\n"
"  `offload_group_size > 0` raises a configuration error."
msgstr ""
"- 弹性专家并行，\n"
"- 旧版 `dynamic_eplb`、记录/静态映射字段，以及 `DYNAMIC_EPLB`\n"
"  和 `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD` 环境变量，这些均属于已移除的\n"
"  Model Runner V1 EPLB 实现，\n"
"- Gloo 和 HIXL 之外的通信器，\n"
"- 权重卸载与预取：在 `cpu_offload_gb > 0` 或\n"
"  `offload_group_size > 0` 时启用 EPLB 会触发配置错误。"

msgid ""
"1. Parameter Tuning:\n"
"    - Tune `window_size` and `step_interval` against the target workload.\n"
"    - `num_redundant_experts` must make `(num_experts +\n"
"      num_redundant_experts)` divisible by the expert-parallel size."
msgstr ""
"1. 参数调优：\n"
"    - 根据目标工作负载调整 `window_size` 和 `step_interval`。\n"
"    - `num_redundant_experts` 必须使 `(num_experts +\n"
"      num_redundant_experts)` 能被专家并行规模整除。"

msgid ""
"3. Monitoring & Validation:\n"
"    - Temporarily enable `--eplb-config.log_balancedness true` to log\n"
"      `EPLB step: ... balancedness=...` per window sample, and check\n"
"      `Ascend async EPLB cycle committed` lines for the per-cycle movement\n"
"      summary (`mean ... -> ...`, changed layers, transfer counts).\n"
"    - Use vLLM monitor to detect imbalances during runtime.\n"
"    - Always verify expert map JSON structure before loading (validate with jq or similar tools)."
msgstr ""
"3. 监控与验证：\n"
"    - 临时启用 `--eplb-config.log_balancedness true`，以按窗口采样记录\n"
"      `EPLB step: ... balancedness=...`，并检查\n"
"      `Ascend async EPLB cycle committed` 行以获取每周期迁移\n"
"      摘要（`mean ... -> ...`、发生变化的层、传输次数）。\n"
"    - 使用 vLLM monitor 在运行时检测不均衡。\n"
"    - 加载前务必校验专家映射 JSON 结构（使用 jq 或类似工具进行验证）。"
